  "title": "STM32N657L0H3Q unused USB power pins?",
  "content": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>I want to design STM32N6 based board and in this board I don’t have any 3.3V supply so what should I do the unused USB power pins? Should I left unconnected or connect them to GND?</p><p> </p><p>Thanks and regards</p>",
